   "text": "Buyers returned in the half-day Black Friday session: S&P 500 +1.6% to 7,297, Nasdaq +2.3% to 24,130, Dow +1.2%; best week since April 2025, led by beaten-down AI names (Micron +7.5%, AMD +4.4%, Tesla +5.2%).",
